# An AUR repo holds the recipe, not what building it produces. makepkg
# leaves the downloaded source, an extracted src/, a staged pkg/ and the
# built package behind in this directory; a stale refrain-0.4.5.tar.gz
# sat here for two releases because nothing was ignoring it.
#
# Deny-by-default, so the next artifact makepkg invents is covered too.
*
!.gitignore
!PKGBUILD
!.SRCINFO
